  "description": "Compact ESP32/Nano-based DCC accessory decoder for model railways. Supports advanced lighting effects (signals, beacons, campfires, welding arcs, etc.) and extensible peripheral control via I2C, UART, and SPI.",
  "keywords": "audio, railway",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/HO44-PROJECT/MrJ-RailwayFX.git"
  },
